---
import ServiceLayout from 'theme/layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';

const serviceData = {
  title: 'Packing Services & Materials',
  slug: 'packing-services',
  metaTitle: 'Professional Packing Services North West London | Pearl Removals',
  metaDescription: 'Expert packing services and premium moving boxes in North West London. Full home packing, fragile-only china packing, and wardrobe boxes based in Cricklewood NW2.',
  heroHeading: 'Professional Packing Services & Premium Materials',
  heroSubheading: 'Save days of arduous effort and ensure your fragile china, crystal, artwork, and wardrobe collections are safeguarded with heavy-duty export-grade packing materials and skilled packers.',
  icon: 'package',
  summary: 'Meticulous packing solutions from fragile-only china wrapping to complete whole-house packing and unpacking.',
  priceFrom: 180,
  priceUnit: 'service',
  priceNotes: 'Indicative guide based on fragile-only packing for a 1-to-2 bedroom property. All professional cartons, wrapping paper, and tape included.',
  benefits: [
    'Save days of exhausting packing time and eliminate moving stress completely',
    'Heavy-duty double-walled corrugated boxes that resist crushing during vehicle transit and stacking',
    'Specialist wardrobe cartons equipped with metal hanging rails to keep garments crease-free',
    'Acid-free packing tissue paper preventing chemical staining or tarnishing on silver and delicate porcelain',
    'Every carton clearly labelled with room destination, box inventory summary, and priority status',
    'Full insurance validity: goods professionally packed by our team enjoy comprehensive transit cover'
  ],
  whatsIncluded: [
    'All export-grade packing materials: double-walled boxes, bubble wrap, tissue, tape, and void fill',
    'Skilled, uniform-clad packing professionals working systematically room by room',
    'Specialist bubble-wrap sleeves for framed artwork, oil paintings, and ornamental mirrors',
    'Wardrobe hanging boxes for suits, coats, and evening wear transferred directly on hangers',
    'Clear labelling and numerical itemisation on every single box for rapid destination room sorting',
    'Collection and eco-friendly disposal of empty boxes upon completion of your unpacking'
  ],
  whatsNotIncluded: [
    'Disposal or packing of open liquids, unsealed cooking oils, or flammable chemicals',
    'Packing of personal legal documents, cash, passbooks, and high-value jewellery (must stay in your custody)',
    'Deep interior cleaning or organisation of wardrobes prior to packing',
    'Permanent fixed joinery dismantling (e.g. built-in wall-to-wall fitted wardrobes)'
  ],
  process: [
    {
      step: 1,
      title: 'Material Estimation & Schedule Plan',
      description: 'During your pre-move survey, we calculate the precise quantity of cartons, wardrobe boxes, tissue reams, and bubble wrap required for your home.'
    },
    {
      step: 2,
      title: 'Packing Day Execution (Normally Day Before)',
      description: 'Our experienced packing team arrives with all materials. Kitchen china, glassware, books, linen, and ornamental pieces are methodically wrapped and cushioned.'
    },
    {
      step: 3,
      title: 'Colour-Coded Labelling & Inventory',
      description: 'Every carton is sealed securely with reinforced vinyl tape and labelled with its destination room (e.g., Master Bedroom, Kitchen) and brief contents description.'
    },
    {
      step: 4,
      title: 'Moving Day Readiness & Optional Unpack',
      description: 'On moving day, vehicles load swiftly because every box is uniform, stackable, and sealed. At your new home, our team can provide surface-level unpacking onto tables and worktops.'
    }
  ],
  premiumAngle: 'In luxury residences across Hampstead Village, Winnington Road, and Primrose Hill, our White-Glove Packing Service includes custom wooden crating for crystal chandeliers and sculpture, acid-free garment wrapping, and a full unpacking team who place items directly into cupboards and wardrobes.',
  faqs: [
    {
      question: 'Why should I pay for professional packing instead of doing it myself?',
      answer: 'Packing a typical 3-bedroom family home takes homeowners an average of 40 to 60 exhausting hours. Our professional crew of 3 to 4 packers completes the entire process in a single day using heavy-duty commercial boxes that stack safely, preventing costly breakages and preserving your energy for moving day.',
      display: true
    },
    {
      question: 'When does the packing service take place?',
      answer: 'For 2-bedroom homes and larger, we typically schedule the packing service on the day immediately preceding your moving date. For smaller studio or 1-bedroom flats, packing can often be completed on the morning of moving day prior to loading.',
      display: true
    },
    {
      question: 'Does professional packing affect my removals insurance?',
      answer: 'Yes. Most removals insurance policies carry strict limitations on "Owner-Packed Goods" (PBO) because insurers cannot verify whether internal breakages resulted from improper packing. When Pearl Removals packs your goods, full Goods in Transit insurance applies to both the transit and the internal contents.',
      display: true
    },
    {
      question: 'Can you pack only my fragile kitchen china, crystal, and mirrors?',
      answer: 'Yes, our Fragile-Only Packing service is one of our most popular options. We take full responsibility for wrapping and packing your delicate chinaware, glassware, ceramics, framed mirrors, and artwork, leaving you to pack straightforward items like books and clothing.',
      display: true
    },
    {
      question: 'What happens to the empty boxes after moving?',
      answer: 'Once you have unpacked in your new home, simply contact our Cricklewood office. We will schedule a complimentary collection of our reusable cardboard boxes, ensuring they are recycled or repurposed responsibly.',
      display: true
    }
  ]
};
---

<ServiceLayout service={serviceData}>
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-navy dark:text-pearl tracking-tight">
      Transforming the Most Demanding Part of Moving Into an Effortless Experience
    </h2>
    <p>
      Ask anyone who has moved home in London what they found most taxing, and the answer is almost universally the same: <em>packing</em>. Sourcing inadequate second-hand grocery boxes, wrapping newspaper around glassware only to leave ink stains, and spending every evening for three weeks living amidst half-sealed cartons creates immense physical and mental fatigue.
    </p>
    <p>
      At <strong>Pearl Removals</strong>, our professional packing teams take this entire burden off your shoulders. Based in Cricklewood, North West London, we arrive equipped with export-quality materials, methodical wrapping protocols, and gentle handling techniques developed over thousands of successful residential relocations.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-pearl pt-4">
      Heavy-Duty Commercial Materials vs Standard Cardboard
    </h3>
    <p>
      The integrity of your possessions during transit depends heavily on the quality of the carton enclosing them. Standard single-walled supermarket or delivery boxes collapse under pressure when stacked inside a removal vehicle.
    </p>
    <p>
      Pearl Removals uses only commercial double-walled corrugated cartons manufactured to withstand vertical compression:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Small Book & Wine Cartons:</strong> Heavy-duty, dense boxes engineered to carry heavy books, canned pantry items, and wine bottles safely without exceeding safe manual lifting thresholds.</li>
      <li><strong>Medium & Large Multi-Purpose Cartons:</strong> Spacious double-walled boxes lined with crushed paper cushioning for kitchen appliances, toys, lampshades, and linens.</li>
      <li><strong>Wardrobe Cartons with Hanging Rails:</strong> Full-length tall wardrobe boxes equipped with steel cross-bars. Your dresses, coats, and tailored suits are transferred straight from your closet on their original hangers, keeping them completely wrinkle-free and clean.</li>
      <li><strong>Acid-Free White Tissue Paper:</strong> Unlike recycled newsprint, our white packing tissue contains zero acidic inks that could bleed onto fine bone china, silver platters, or porous ceramics.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-pearl pt-4">
      Flexible Packing Tiers to Suit Your Budget & Lifestyle
    </h3>
    <p>
      We offer three tailored packing tiers to match your specific schedule and moving requirements:
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Full Home Packing Service:</strong> Our team packs your entire residence—from the attic and kitchen cupboards to the garden shed—usually the day prior to your move. You simply pack an overnight bag, and we handle every other item.</li>
      <li><strong>Fragile-Only Packing:</strong> We concentrate our expertise where it matters most: kitchen glassware, delicate dinner sets, porcelain figurines, vases, chandeliers, framed family photos, and ornate mirrors.</li>
      <li><strong>Self-Pack Material Bundles:</strong> If you prefer to pack yourself, we deliver a customized bundle of double-walled boxes, bubble wrap, tissue, and heavy-duty vinyl tape straight to your front door well in advance.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-pearl pt-4">
      Systematic Labelling for Stress-Free Unpacking
    </h3>
    <p>
      There is nothing more frustrating on moving night than opening ten unmarked brown boxes searching for a kettle, mugs, or phone chargers. Every carton packed by Pearl Removals is systematically inscribed with its destination room, a concise content summary, and designated priority tags.
    </p>
    <p>
      We also pack a dedicated "Day-One Essentials Box" containing your immediate needs—kettle, tea bags, mugs, bathroom essentials, basic cutlery, and bedding—ensuring your first night in your new London home is peaceful and relaxed.
    </p>
  </div>
</ServiceLayout>
